  "body": "This also removes the DOMElementMap interface, thus ridding the platform of one more exotic object.\n\n---\n\nMaybe we should instead redesign the interface to use maplike? Regardless, I am not that happy having this sit unimplemented for ... what, four years? ... and still leaving it in the spec. Hopefully @tabatkins can tell us what's up.\n",
